      "description": "**The migration path, end to end.**\n\nThis is the *unmodified* legacy edges CSV from [sankey.json](./sankey.json), run through **Convert field type** (`mainstat` \u2192 number) and then **Rows to fields** with **no options at all**.\n\nAuto-detection takes the first string column (`id`) as the field name and the first numeric column (`mainstat`) as the value; every other column falls through to `field.labels`. The column headers below are the resulting display names \u2014 `e1 {source=\"gateway\", target=\"api\"}` \u2014 which is `field.name` followed by the label set.\n\nThe `convertFieldType` step is mandatory: with no numeric field, `rowsToFields` silently returns its input unchanged.",
