      "description": "**Dense, edge-per-field.** Worked example 5: three nodes fully connected is six edge fields \u2014 the N\u00b7(N\u22121) growth. Every ribbon stays individually addressable, and `b-->a` carries a fixed colour to prove it at density.\n\nAt 30 nodes this form is 870 fields, which is the ceiling the contract states.",
      "fieldConfig": {
